# ⚡ EV-Dashboard-ADAS

## Real-Time Electric Vehicle Dashboard and ADAS Warning System using STM32 Blue Pill

A real-time embedded system project that combines **Electric Vehicle control, sensor monitoring, ADAS warning functions, fault management, UART diagnostics, and a Python-based dashboard** using the **STM32 Blue Pill (STM32F103C8T6)**.

---

## 🎯 Project Objective

The objective of this project is to develop a simulated real-time EV control and safety system capable of:

* Monitoring EV parameters
* Controlling motor torque and drive modes
* Measuring obstacle distances using ultrasonic sensors
* Providing Forward Collision Warning
* Calculating Time-to-Collision (TTC)
* Detecting blind spots
* Monitoring motor temperature and battery SOC
* Handling critical system faults
* Providing UART-based diagnostics
* Displaying live telemetry through a Python dashboard

