## 🖥️ Python Dashboard

A Python dashboard is included for visualizing system telemetry.

Location:

```text
Python/dashboard.py
```

The dashboard displays:

* Vehicle speed
* Battery SOC
* Estimated range
* Motor torque
* Motor temperature
* Accelerator percentage
* Brake percentage
* Front obstacle distance
* Left obstacle distance
* Right obstacle distance
* TTC
* Collision warning
* Blind-spot warning
* Alarm status
* Fault status
* Drive mode
* Speed history

### Demo Mode

The dashboard can be tested without hardware:

```bash
python dashboard.py --demo
```

### UART Mode

For connection to STM32/PICSimLab:

```bash
python dashboard.py --port COM3
```

The baud rate used by default is:

```text
115200
```

