## ⏱️ Timers

The project uses STM32 timers for different purposes.

### TIM1

Used for PWM motor control.

```text
Prescaler = 71
Period = 9999
PWM Channel = TIM1 Channel 1
```

### TIM2

Used as a high-resolution timing counter for ultrasonic timing.

```text
Prescaler = 71
Period = 65535
```

### TIM3

Configured as an additional timer for periodic system tasks.

```text
Prescaler = 7199
Period = 999
```

